<title>JAPAN: Shimadzu to issue 20 bln yen convertible.</title>
<headline>Shimadzu to issue 20 bln yen convertible.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Shimadzu Corp</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Nikko Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TRUSTEE - Tokyo-Mitsubishi Bank</p>
<p> TYPE convertible	    ISSUE NO   13     AMT   20 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 0.95%(tentatively) ISSU PRICE	  MATURITY 30.Sep.05</p>
<p> CONV PRICE		    CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 01.Nov.96	 CONV TO 29.Sep.05</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 14.Oct.96  INT PAY end-Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 07-11 Oct</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on October 4.</p>
</text>
